    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/1acc7688c4477df0c5391488038808d6.poster.avif?t=1744838984\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/1acc7688c4477df0c5391488038808d6.webm?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/1acc7688c4477df0c5391488038808d6.mp4?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were heading to your first mission, but something went terribly wrong. Now, trapped in an isolated scientific complex, the researchers have disappeared, and the artificial intelligence you were supposed to supervise has gone rogue. Your fate and that of those around you depend on your words and decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror in first-person with exploration and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/8850c75e76491a1b0c0cc10b0f119b28.poster.avif?t=1744838984\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/8850c75e76491a1b0c0cc10b0f119b28.webm?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/8850c75e76491a1b0c0cc10b0f119b28.mp4?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs powered by advanced AI that react in real-time to your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/232094a122f611f9e980a2d2ec44899d.poster.avif?t=1744838984\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/232094a122f611f9e980a2d2ec44899d.webm?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/232094a122f611f9e980a2d2ec44899d.mp4?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/1acc7688c4477df0c5391488038808d6.poster.avif?t=1744838984\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/1acc7688c4477df0c5391488038808d6.webm?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/1acc7688c4477df0c5391488038808d6.mp4?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were heading to your first mission, but something went terribly wrong. Now, trapped in an isolated scientific complex, the researchers have disappeared, and the artificial intelligence you were supposed to supervise has gone rogue. Your fate and that of those around you depend on your words and decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror in first-person with exploration and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/8850c75e76491a1b0c0cc10b0f119b28.poster.avif?t=1744838984\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/8850c75e76491a1b0c0cc10b0f119b28.webm?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/8850c75e76491a1b0c0cc10b0f119b28.mp4?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs powered by advanced AI that react in real-time to your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/232094a122f611f9e980a2d2ec44899d.poster.avif?t=1744838984\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/232094a122f611f9e980a2d2ec44899d.webm?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246600/extras/232094a122f611f9e980a2d2ec44899d.mp4?t=1744838984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
